OL,3,GNEWSAMan given indefinite sentence for
OL,4,Akilling widowed dad of 11 with 'big
OL,5,Aheart'
OL,6,
OL,7,FA mentally ill man who fatally stabbed
OL,8,Fa "deeply compassionate" widowed father
OL,9,Fof 11 has been given an indefinite
OL,10,Fsentence under the mental health act.
OL,12,FIn August, Mujeeb Rahman Hassani, 41,
OL,13,Ffrom Cardiff, was found guilty of the
OL,14,Fmanslaughter of Ibrahim Yassin, 64,
OL,15,Ffrom Cardiff, on the grounds of
OL,16,Fdiminished responsibility.
OL,18,FYassin's family described him as
OL,19,Fsomeone with a "big heart" who had
OL,20,Festablished a free funeral charity for
OL,21,Fthose who could not afford it.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,440,430,260,140,0,100
