OL,3,GNEWSAMan given indefinite sentence for
OL,4,Akilling widowed dad of 11 with 'big
OL,5,Aheart'
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe court heard Hassani, who has
OL,8,Fparanoid schizophrenia, had been
OL,9,Freleased from a mental health unit
OL,10,Fthree days before the killing on 18
OL,11,FFebruary 2024.
